Add OAuth token check at the start of `isProfileAuthenticated()`:

```typescript
export function isProfileAuthenticated(profile: ClaudeProfile): boolean {
  // Check for OAuth token first (direct auth)
  if (profile.oauthToken) {
    return true;
  }

  // Existing: Check for configDir-based credentials...
  const configDir = profile.configDir;
  // ...rest of function
}
```

