## Bug #2: 5-Minute Auth Failure Cooldown Bypass (CRITICAL)

### Location
`apps/frontend/src/main/claude-profile/usage-monitor.ts` lines 1157-1159

### Evidence

When proactive swap is disabled (or for API profiles), `handleAuthFailure()` returns early **without marking the profile in `authFailedProfiles`**:

```typescript
