## Summary

The changelog generation feature has multiple critical bugs that prevent users from generating changelogs:

1. **"Can't find any done tasks"** - Completed tasks are not detected
2. **"Stuck at 30%"** - Generation hangs indefinitely even with only 2 commits
3. **Finding commits on GitHub works** - Git-based changelog generation is unaffected

This issue documents the root causes found through deep investigation across 18 parallel analysis sessions.

